{"subject": "📊 Daily Portfolio: Markets closed | $453 to $1,000 goal, still in cash", "html_body": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n</head>\n<body style=\"margin: 0; padding: 0; background-color: #f4f5f7; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: #111827;\">\n\n<table role=\"presentation\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"100%\" style=\"background-color: #f4f5f7; padding: 24px 12px;\">\n  <tr>\n    <td align=\"center\">\n      <table role=\"presentation\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"600\" style=\"max-width: 600px; background-color: #ffffff; border-radius: 12px; overflow: hidden;\">\n\n        <!-- HERO BANNER -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1e293b 0%, #334155 100%); padding: 32px 24px; color: #ffffff;\">\n            <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-transform: uppercase; color: #94a3b8;\">Daily Portfolio Check</p>\n            <p style=\"margin: 4px 0 16px 0; font-size: 14px; color: #cbd5e1;\">Sunday, August 2, 2026 — Kuwait time — Markets closed (weekend)</p>\n\n            <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\n              <tr>\n                <td>\n                  <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 11px; color: #94a3b8; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Total P&amp;L (open positions)</p>\n                  <p style=\"margin: 4px 0 0 0; font-size: 36px; font-weight: 700; color: #9ca3af;\">$0.00 <span style=\"font-size: 16px; opacity: 0.8;\">— no open positions</span></p>\n                </td>\n                <td align=\"right\" valign=\"bottom\">\n                  <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 11px; color: #94a3b8; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Today</p>\n                  <p style=\"margin: 4px 0 0 0; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600; color: #9ca3af;\">Market closed</p>\n                </td>\n              </tr>\n            </table>\n\n            <p style=\"margin: 16px 0 0 0; padding-top: 16px; border-top: 1px solid #475569; font-size: 13px; color: #e2e8f0;\">Day 6 fully in cash since the CAPR stop-out (Jul 27). Nothing to react to this weekend — Friday's session and the macro backdrop are the whole story.</p>\n\n            <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"margin-top: 14px; background-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px;\">\n              <tr>\n                <td style=\"padding: 10px 12px;\">\n                  <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 13px; color: #f1f5f9;\">🎯 <strong>Investment goal:</strong> $546.58 / $1,000 — <strong style=\"color: #cbd5e1;\">$453.42 to go</strong> (54.7% there)</p>\n                  <p style=\"margin: 4px 0 0 0; font-size: 11px; color: #fca5a5;\">⚠️ Target date (Jul 31, 2026) has passed. Progress indicator only — doesn't change entry discipline.</p>\n                </td>\n              </tr>\n            </table>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- MACRO CONTEXT -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding: 16px 24px; background-color: #0d0d0d; border-left: 3px solid #f59e0b;\">\n            <p style=\"margin: 0 0 8px 0; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; color: #f59e0b; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">🌍 Macro Context — Aug 2, 2026</p>\n            <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"font-size: 13px; color: #e5e7eb; font-family: monospace;\">\n              <tr><td style=\"padding: 3px 0; color: #9ca3af;\">Buffett Indicator</td><td style=\"padding: 3px 0; text-align: right;\">234.3% <span style=\"background-color: #7f1d1d; color: #fecaca; padding: 1px 8px; border-radius: 10px; font-family: -apple-system, sans-serif; font-size: 11px;\">🔴 ALL-TIME EXTREME</span></td></tr>\n              <tr><td style=\"padding: 3px 0; color: #9ca3af;\">S&amp;P Forward P/E</td><td style=\"padding: 3px 0; text-align: right;\">~21x (vs. 10-yr avg ~18.9x)</td></tr>\n              <tr><td style=\"padding: 3px 0; color: #9ca3af;\">Trend</td><td style=\"padding: 3px 0; text-align: right;\">↑ Rising (228.5% Jul 27 → 234.3% latest)</td></tr>\n            </table>\n            <p style=\"margin: 10px 0 0 0; font-size: 12px; color: #d1d5db; line-height: 1.6;\">Total US market cap is now 2.34x GDP — every prior reading above 190% has preceded a multi-year drawdown, and this reading is 44 points past that line, in territory with no clean historical precedent. Forward P/E (~21x) is elevated versus the 10-year average but nowhere near as extreme a signal as the Buffett Indicator right now.</p>\n            <p style=\"margin: 6px 0 0 0; font-size: 12px; color: #d1d5db; line-height: 1.6;\">With zero open positions, this isn't a risk-management question today — it's an entry-discipline one. A stretched macro tape is exactly the environment where forcing capital to work \"to hit the goal\" does the most damage.</p>\n            <p style=\"margin: 8px 0 0 0; font-size: 11px; color: #6b7280;\">Last historical episodes near this level: 2000 dot-com peak (~172%), 2021 post-COVID peak (~200%) — current reading has no clean historical precedent this high.</p>\n            <p style=\"margin: 6px 0 0 0; font-size: 10px; color: #6b7280;\">Source: GuruFocus (234.3%, USA Ratio of Total Market Cap over GDP, Jul 2026 reading), MacroMicro (228.5%, Jul 27 2026). See references/buffett-indicator-history.html for case studies.</p>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- POSITION SNAPSHOT -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding: 16px 24px 24px 24px;\">\n            <p style=\"margin: 0 0 12px 0; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600;\">Position Snapshot</p>\n            <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 13px;\">\n              <thead>\n                <tr style=\"background-color: #f9fafb;\">\n                  <th style=\"text-align: left; padding: 10px 8px; font-weight: 600; color: #6b7280; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb;\">Status</th>\n                  <th style=\"text-align: left; padding: 10px 8px; font-weight: 600; color: #6b7280; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb;\">Holding</th>\n                  <th style=\"text-align: right; padding: 10px 8px; font-weight: 600; color: #6b7280; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb;\">Value</th>\n                </tr>\n              </thead>\n              <tbody>\n                <tr>\n                  <td style=\"padding: 12px 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #f3f4f6;\">\n                    <span style=\"display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px; background-color: #d1fae5; color: #059669; border-radius: 10px; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600;\">✅ HOLD</span>\n                  </td>\n                  <td style=\"padding: 12px 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #f3f4f6; font-weight: 600;\">CASH</td>\n                  <td style=\"padding: 12px 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #f3f4f6; text-align: right; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;\">$546.58</td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr style=\"background-color: #f9fafb;\">\n                  <td colspan=\"2\" style=\"padding: 12px 8px; font-weight: 700;\">TOTAL</td>\n                  <td style=\"padding: 12px 8px; text-align: right; font-weight: 700; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;\">$546.58</td>\n                </tr>\n              </tbody>\n            </table>\n            <p style=\"margin: 10px 0 0 0; font-size: 12px; color: #6b7280;\">No open positions — 100% cash. No exit alerts, no stop/TP checks needed today.</p>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- MOVERS -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding: 0 24px 24px 24px;\">\n            <p style=\"margin: 0 0 4px 0; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600;\">📈 Friday's Movers — Jul 31, 2026</p>\n            <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 12px; margin-bottom: 8px;\">\n              <thead>\n                <tr style=\"background-color: #f9fafb;\">\n                  <th style=\"text-align: left; padding: 8px 6px; font-weight: 600; color: #6b7280; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb;\">Ticker</th>\n                  <th style=\"text-align: right; padding: 8px 6px; font-weight: 600; color: #6b7280; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb;\">+%</th>\n                  <th style=\"text-align: left; padding: 8px 6px; font-weight: 600; color: #6b7280; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb;\">What happened</th>\n                  <th style=\"text-align: left; padding: 8px 6px; font-weight: 600; color: #6b7280; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb;\">Type</th>\n                </tr>\n              </thead>\n              <tbody>\n                <tr>\n                  <td style=\"padding: 8px 6px; border-bottom: 1px solid #f3f4f6; font-weight: 600;\">REPL</td>\n                  <td style=\"padding: 8px 6px; border-bottom: 1px solid #f3f4f6; text-align: right; color: #059669;\">+127%</td>\n                  <td style=\"padding: 8px 6px; border-bottom: 1px solid #f3f4f6;\">FDA advisory panel voted 10-3 that IGNYTE trial results for RP1 (melanoma, combo with nivolumab) are evaluable and clinically meaningful — ahead of the Aug 2 FDA decision.</td>\n                  <td style=\"padding: 8px 6px; border-bottom: 1px solid #f3f4f6;\">FDA</td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr>\n                  <td style=\"padding: 8px 6px; border-bottom: 1px solid #f3f4f6; font-weight: 600;\">APMD</td>\n                  <td style=\"padding: 8px 6px; border-bottom: 1px solid #f3f4f6; text-align: right; color: #059669;\">+37.5%</td>\n                  <td style=\"padding: 8px 6px; border-bottom: 1px solid #f3f4f6;\">NASDAQ debut — upsized IPO priced at $16 (top of range), raised $192M, opened at $22.</td>\n                  <td style=\"padding: 8px 6px; border-bottom: 1px solid #f3f4f6;\">IPO</td>\n                </tr>\n              </tbody>\n            </table>\n            <p style=\"margin: 0 0 16px 0; font-size: 11px; color: #6b7280;\">Halal check: both clean by business activity (oncology biotech, sleep-apnea biotech). Neither touches a current position or watchlist name — portfolio is 100% cash. No 3rd gainer independently verified at ≥20% for this session — not listing an unconfirmed name.</p>\n\n            <p style=\"margin: 0 0 4px 0; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600;\">📉 Friday's Losers — Jul 31, 2026</p>\n            <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 12px;\">\n              <thead>\n                <tr style=\"background-color: #f9fafb;\">\n                  <th style=\"text-align: left; padding: 8px 6px; font-weight: 600; color: #6b7280; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb;\">Ticker</th>\n                  <th style=\"text-align: right; padding: 8px 6px; font-weight: 600; color: #6b7280; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb;\">-%</th>\n                  <th style=\"text-align: left; padding: 8px 6px; font-weight: 600; color: #6b7280; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb;\">What happened</th>\n                  <th style=\"text-align: left; padding: 8px 6px; font-weight: 600; color: #6b7280; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb;\">Type</th>\n                </tr>\n              </thead>\n              <tbody>\n                <tr>\n                  <td style=\"padding: 8px 6px; border-bottom: 1px solid #f3f4f6; font-weight: 600;\">RDDT</td>\n                  <td style=\"padding: 8px 6px; border-bottom: 1px solid #f3f4f6; text-align: right; color: #dc2626;\">-21%</td>\n                  <td style=\"padding: 8px 6px; border-bottom: 1px solid #f3f4f6;\">Q2 beat on revenue/profit (ad revenue +64%) but no new AI data-licensing deals announced + soft US daily-active-user trend overshadowed the print — largest single-day drop since IPO.</td>\n                  <td style=\"padding: 8px 6px; border-bottom: 1px solid #f3f4f6;\">Earnings/Guidance</td>\n                </tr>\n              </tbody>\n            </table>\n            <p style=\"margin: 6px 0 0 0; font-size: 11px; color: #6b7280;\">AAPL (-8%) and ALHC (-18%) also moved on earnings Friday but didn't clear the 20% filter — excluded. No contagion — no open positions or active watchlist names in these sectors.</p>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- LARGE-CAP ON DECK -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding: 0 24px 24px 24px;\">\n            <p style=\"margin: 0 0 8px 0; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600;\">🏢 Large-cap on deck — next 21 days</p>\n            <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 12px;\">\n              <thead>\n                <tr style=\"background-color: #f9fafb;\">\n                  <th style=\"text-align: left; padding: 8px 6px; font-weight: 600; color: #6b7280; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb;\">Ticker</th>\n                  <th style=\"text-align: left; padding: 8px 6px; font-weight: 600; color: #6b7280; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb;\">Event</th>\n                  <th style=\"text-align: left; padding: 8px 6px; font-weight: 600; color: #6b7280; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb;\">Date</th>\n                  <th style=\"text-align: left; padding: 8px 6px; font-weight: 600; color: #6b7280; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb;\">Setup</th>\n                  <th style=\"text-align: left; padding: 8px 6px; font-weight: 600; color: #6b7280; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb;\">Direction</th>\n                </tr>\n              </thead>\n              <tbody>\n                <tr>\n                  <td style=\"padding: 8px 6px; border-bottom: 1px solid #f3f4f6; font-weight: 600;\">AMD</td>\n                  <td style=\"padding: 8px 6px; border-bottom: 1px solid #f3f4f6;\">Q2 Earnings</td>\n                  <td style=\"padding: 8px 6px; border-bottom: 1px solid #f3f4f6;\">Aug 4 (2 days)</td>\n                  <td style=\"padding: 8px 6px; border-bottom: 1px solid #f3f4f6;\">Own guide: ~$11.2B revenue (+46% YoY), gross margin to ~56% on MI350 data-center demand. Consensus $1.61 EPS, 35/45 analysts Strong Buy.</td>\n                  <td style=\"padding: 8px 6px; border-bottom: 1px solid #f3f4f6;\">🟢 Bullish</td>\n                </tr>\n              </tbody>\n            </table>\n            <p style=\"margin: 8px 0 0 0; font-size: 13px; color: #4b5563;\">💡 <strong>AMD earnings Aug 4</strong> — data-center AI GPU momentum still accelerating per management's own guide; margin expansion is the tell to watch. Say <code>analyze AMD</code> for the full setup.</p>\n            <p style=\"margin: 8px 0 0 0; font-size: 11px; color: #6b7280;\">Next nearest events outside the window: NVDA Aug 26 (24 days), AVGO Sep 3, TSM ~Oct 15 — all past the 21-day radar.</p>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- PENDING WATCHLIST -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding: 0 24px 24px 24px;\">\n            <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"background-color: #1a1400; border-left: 3px solid #f59e0b; border-radius: 8px;\">\n              <tr>\n                <td style=\"padding: 16px 20px;\">\n                  <p style=\"margin: 0 0 8px 0; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #fbbf24;\">⏳ Pending Watchlist</p>\n                  <p style=\"margin: 0 0 10px 0; font-size: 12px; color: #fde68a;\">No active candidates. All 4 tracked names have resolved and are archived — kept here for reference, not action:</p>\n                  <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"font-size: 11px; color: #fde68a; font-family: monospace;\">\n                    <tr><td style=\"padding: 3px 0;\">CELC</td><td style=\"padding: 3px 0;\">Exited Jul 15 — sell-the-news post-approval — <span style=\"color: #fca5a5;\">−$26.32</span></td></tr>\n                    <tr><td style=\"padding: 3px 0;\">CAPR</td><td style=\"padding: 3px 0;\">Stopped out Jul 27, gap fill on plain STOP — <span style=\"color: #fca5a5;\">−$234.73</span></td></tr>\n                    <tr><td style=\"padding: 3px 0;\">VRDN</td><td style=\"padding: 3px 0;\">Approved Jun 30 — entry missed (broker blocker) — no fill</td></tr>\n                    <tr><td style=\"padding: 3px 0;\">VERA</td><td style=\"padding: 3px 0;\">SL hit Jul 17 post-approval drift — <span style=\"color: #fca5a5;\">−$33.28</span></td></tr>\n                  </table>\n                  <p style=\"margin: 10px 0 0 0; font-size: 11px; color: #fde68a;\">No fresh candidate is auto-generated here — run <strong>stock-finder</strong> when you want new names to evaluate.</p>\n                </td>\n              </tr>\n            </table>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- CASH DEPLOYMENT -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding: 0 24px 24px 24px;\">\n            <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"background-color: #eff6ff; border: 1px solid #bfdbfe; border-radius: 8px;\">\n              <tr>\n                <td style=\"padding: 16px 20px;\">\n                  <p style=\"margin: 0 0 6px 0; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #1e40af;\">💵 Cash deployment — $544.58 available (after $2 reserve)</p>\n                  <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 12px; color: #1e3a8a; line-height: 1.7;\">\n                    No open positions to add to, and no discovery candidate is generated automatically here — that's <strong>stock-finder</strong> (runs Tue/Sun) or <strong>halal-stock-picker</strong> for a vetted monthly list. With the Buffett Indicator at an all-time-extreme 234%, there's no case for forcing capital to work over a weekend just to chase the goal tracker.<br>\n                    <em>Your call — run stock-finder for next candidates.</em>\n                  </p>\n                </td>\n              </tr>\n            </table>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- ROTATION -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding: 0 24px 24px 24px;\">\n            <p style=\"margin: 0 0 8px 0; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600;\">🔄 Rotation Suggestions</p>\n            <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 13px; color: #6b7280;\">None — no open positions to rotate out of, and no active watchlist candidate to rotate into.</p>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- EDUCATION MODULE -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding: 0 24px 24px 24px;\">\n            <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"background-color: #f1f5f9; border-radius: 8px;\">\n              <tr>\n                <td style=\"padding: 20px 24px;\">\n                  <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 11px; color: #475569; font-weight: 600; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">📚 Today you learned</p>\n                  <p style=\"margin: 8px 0 0 0; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; color: #0f172a;\">Cash as a Position — The Hidden Cost of Forcing a Trade</p>\n                  <p style=\"margin: 12px 0 0 0; font-size: 13px; color: #1e293b; line-height: 1.7;\">\n                    You've been in 100% cash for six sessions since the CAPR stop-out, and with a $453 gap to the $1,000 goal and its deadline already blown, the itch to \"do something\" is real. But cash is a position, not an absence of one — sitting idle is an active bet that no available setup beats waiting. With the Buffett Indicator at an all-time-extreme 234%, that's frequently the right bet. The cost of forcing a mediocre entry is immediate and visible: a stop that gets tested, $1-2 in round-trip commission burned on nothing. The cost of staying in cash is only opportunity cost — silent, easy to underweight, and the reason traders coming off a loss (like CAPR) tend to overtrade trying to \"make it back.\" Let stock-finder hand you the next setup instead of manufacturing one.\n                  </p>\n                  <p style=\"margin: 12px 0 0 0; font-size: 12px; color: #475569; font-style: italic;\">\n                    Also today: <strong>Sunk cost fallacy</strong> — the CAPR loss is already realized and has zero bearing on whether tomorrow's next trade is a good one; you don't \"need\" a win to make it back.\n                  </p>\n                </td>\n              </tr>\n            </table>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- FOOTER -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding: 16px 24px 24px 24px; border-top: 1px solid #f3f4f6;\">\n            <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 10px; color: #9ca3af; line-height: 1.5;\">\n              Research output, not financial advice. Past performance does not guarantee future results.\n              Verify halal compliance quarterly on Zoya or Musaffa. No open positions — no live price feed needed today.\n              Movers/macro sourced via web search (GuruFocus, MacroMicro, company earnings coverage, SEC filings, FDA panel reporting) — Aug 2, 2026, Kuwait time.\n            </p>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n      </table>\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n</table>\n\n</body>\n</html>\n"}